sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Purchasing / Store User
    participant PR as Purchase Requisition
    participant Club as PR Clubbing Engine
    participant RFQ as RFQ & Quotations
    participant PO as Purchase Order
    participant GRN as Goods Receipt (GRN)
    participant QC as Quality Control
    participant Inv as Inventory Transaction Ledger

    User->>PR: Create Purchase Requisition (Status: DRAFT -> SUBMITTED)
    PR->>Club: Consolidate eligible PR items across departments
    Club->>RFQ: Generate RFQ for consolidated items
    RFQ->>RFQ: Collect Vendor Quotations & Run Rate Comparison
    User->>PO: Award & Generate PO from Quotation (Approval Workflow)
    PO->>PO: Define Delivery Schedules & Payment Milestones
    PO->>GRN: Material arrives at Gate -> Create GRN Draft
    GRN->>QC: Record Received Qty -> Trigger Inspection
    QC->>GRN: Save Accepted / Rejected / Rework Qty
    GRN->>Inv: Insert INVENTORY_TRANSACTION (Type: BOM FG Transfer / Receipt)
    Inv->>Inv: Stock balance updated for Master Item
